# Provider-free backend: no AI API key, model, or billing configuration is needed.
# AI generation remains unavailable even when obsolete provider secrets exist.
# Offline ZeroGPU staging has no environment-variable activation switch.
# HF_TOKEN, a Space ID, model ID, and billing/quota flags are not read.
# Do not add a token here to attempt activation; main:app stays disabled.
# Review-only optional entrypoint: approved_main:app, NOT enabled by this file.
# ZEROGPU_EXECUTION_APPROVED=false
# ZEROGPU_MAX_ATTEMPTS=6
# ZEROGPU_BUDGET_PATH=/trusted/persistent/.zerogpu-budget.sqlite3
# Optional runtime needs HF_TOKEN and ZEROGPU_BACKEND_KEY from secure secrets.
# Never use HF_WRITE_TOKEN at runtime. Do not arm budgets or enable execution
# before separate live-execution approval. See space_app/README.md.
# Never commit a populated .env.
# Required local chat accounts: JSON mapping usernames to salted password hashes.
# Never store plaintext passwords here. Run:
#   .venv/bin/python create_chat_user.py --username your-user
# It prompts privately and updates only the untracked backend/.env, without
# printing passwords/hashes. Missing or invalid auth config disables /chat.
CHAT_AUTH_USERS=

# Per-authenticated-user sliding window, in one server process.
# Range: requests 1–10000; window 1–86400 seconds. Invalid settings fail closed.
CHAT_RATE_LIMIT_REQUESTS=10
CHAT_RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_SECONDS=60
